'''Loincloth Cat '''(ねこななふん Neko Nanafun) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Loincloth Cat
|image = E 140.png
|first appearance = [[Skirting Danger (Veteran)]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 28|Infernal Tower - Floor 28]]
|money drop = 950¢ - 3,752¢
}}

==Enemy==
Loincloth Cat has pretty low health and attack damage compared to other Awakened enemies. It has slightly slower movement speed than its cat [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|counterpart]], but has a very fast attack cycle and hits from extreme range.

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|wave attacker]] that can reach Loincloth Cat will be very good against this enemy (this is apparent in [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 28|Floor 28]]). Some examples are [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Wonder MOMOCO (Legend Rare Cat)|Wonder MOMOCO]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] and more, although their [[Wave Attack]] level must be 4 or above in order to reach it. Other cats that will work are cats with an extremely high range, like [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Super Galaxy Cosmo]], or cats that have a very high effective [[Long Distance]] range, like [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]], although another lower ranged enemy is needed for them to actually snipe Loincloth Cats hiding behind cover.

